| Navigation | 30000ms | 60000ms |
| Screenshot | 10000ms | 30000ms |
| Asset download | 10000ms | 30000ms |

### Output Directories

| Type | Default |
|------|---------|
| Single page | `./cloned-design` |
| Multi-page | `./cloned-designs/{timestamp}-{domain}` |
| Assets | `./output/assets` |

